    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>Until the spell ends, sleet falls in a 40-foot-tall, 20-foot-radius Cylinder centered on a point you choose within range. The area is Heavilyobscured, and exposed flames in the area are doused.</p><p>Ground in the Cylinder is Difficultterrain. When a creature enters the Cylinder for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, it must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or have the Prone condition and lose Concentration.</p>",
